  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_add_q15.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_add_q15.c ****  * \par
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_add_q15.c ****  * The function uses saturating arithmetic.
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_add_q15.c ****  * Results outside of the allowable Q15 range [0x8000 0x7FFF] will be saturated.
